My rates for each section of a place I visited is from {1} as worst to {10} as best.

*Staff- receptionist {8}
- therapists {3}

The receptionist was so lovely and accomedatimg, however, staff were seem too tired and working without any desires.

*Size & Price {3}
Price is regular same as most places , the size of the place is small and tiny and the room is kinda cold and uncomfortable as the air conditioner was blowing air strongly in such small closed room.

*Cleaning & hygiene {1}
As the therapist washed my feet then continued the massage and from there to upper head and neck without cleaning or washing her hand, also the towels were used felt kinda wet already.

*Quality & Experiences {1}
Frankly speaking it was one of the worst massage experiences I have ever had, actually I have asked for the best therapist they got but unfortunately I have received the worst experience and left the shop with muscles pain instead of relieving or relaxing.

If the one therapist I got was considered the best they have then how the worst could be.

Would i ever consider coming back here for a second trial?? sorry but NO i would never.

@Tee Massage
Pratunam,Indra Square Building. Bangkok
Relaxing And Good Message. Hidden Shop But Open Place. Never Mind Bad. Welcome.
